  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* Updated internal Polyfill version from 9.23.0 to 10.1.1\n* Removed deprecated code marked for removal in CliInvoke v3\n* Simplified ``ProcessConfiguration``'s public constructor and made the prior ``public`` constructor ``protected`` to assist in implementing Builders around ``ProcessConfiguration``\n* Added a new enum ``OutputRedirectionMode`` for clarifying how output should be Redirected (Not Redirected, Buffered, or Piped) - This replaces ``RedirectStandardOutput`` and ``RedirectStandardError`` properties in ``ProcessConfiguration`` and the relevant ``IProcessConfigurationBuilder`` method\n* Added methods to ``IProcessConfigurationBuilder`` to allow configuring UserCredential, Arguments, Environment Variables, and Process Resource Policies via their respective builders through IProcessConfigurationBuilder - these methods have a ``Configure`` prefix to distinguish them from other methods\n* Removed ``IProcessConfigurationFactory``\n* Removed some duplicative/overlapping methods from various Builder interfaces\n* Renamed ``IProcessConfigurationBuilder``'s ``ConfigureWindowCreation`` to ``EnableWindowCreation``\n* Added ``ProcessCancellationPolicy`` and made changes to ``ProcessTimeoutPolicy`` to decouple cancellation policy from Timeout Policy and so it can be configured differently for Timeout Policy and Requested Cancellation if desired\n* Reduced ``ProcessTimeoutPolicy`` default ``TimeoutThreshold`` from 30 minutes to 10 minutes\n* Renamed ``IRunnerProcessFactory`` to ``IRunnerConfigurationFactory`` - This functionality has been moved to new extension method code for ``ProcessConfiguration`` within CliInvoke.Core\n* Shortened the namepace for ``IRunnerConfigurationFactory`` \n* Reduced potentially excessive OS support warnings for ``ProcessResourcePolicy``\n* Updated ``IFilePathResolver``'s path resolving method to return a different result type",
